{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/18","id":4996457338,"node_id":"PR_kwDON1sLX88AAAABKc_jeg","html_url":"https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/18","diff_url":"https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/18.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/pull/18.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/issues/18","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/18/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/18/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/issues/18/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/konard/konard.github.io/statuses/71d2a9b44d230a60c96ae0a4cf46db4bde98c31a","number":18,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add configurable link network editor, image downloads and sharing","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Clicking a gallery card now opens `/network/?code=…` with that exact network. The page edits its notations and individual links, configures its SVG, and downloads or shares the resulting picture. The small share icon appears on hover or keyboard focus and opens the sharing section.\n\nFixes #17\n\n- Edit theory notation (L → L² or R → R²), pairs, the N-ary number, exact decimal index and links notation. Supports every gallery configuration and networks of 1–9 links, with add/remove, reference editing, previous/next, random and canonical renaming.\n- Configure endpoint angles and per-link turns; start/end/middle markers and sizes; curves, loops, spacing, margins and rotation; colours, line styles, opacity and glow; transparent/solid/gradient backgrounds; optional cards and border styles. Includes plain black without a card, presets, captions, image sizes and saved styles.\n- Download SVG, PNG, JPEG, WebP and `.lino`; copy the link, image or SVG; use native sharing where supported or ten social/email share links. The address preserves the complete picture, theory notation and explicit page language.\n- Opt into experimental overlap reduction by adjusting endpoint angles; inspect the score, apply the turns or clear them.\n\nRecovered the interrupted session requested in the PR comment. Reproduced and fixed its unfinished sticky-preview layout, partial notation parsing, inconsistent collision scoring/clamped applied turns, receiver-dependent theory captions and lost language parameters. Each correctness fix has a regression test; the layout has before/after screenshots and a browser visibility assertion.\n\nVerification:\n\n[CI passed on final commit `71d2a9b`](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/actions/runs/40115390362).\n\n- All 565 unit/data/workflow tests; lint, formatting, line limits, secret scan, production build and dependency audit (0 vulnerabilities).\n- Chromium browser checks are now part of CI: gallery navigation, editable notations/invalid input, styling, solver application, URL round trips in a fresh browser, actual downloaded file contents/dimensions/transparency, language reload and 360–1920 px layouts in EN/RU. The browser suite also passed in Firefox.\n- All 120 CV PDFs passed the existing page-count, text-layer and reading-order checks.\n- Bounded solver experiment: 507 of 720 three-link classes improved, 213 unchanged, none worse. Default gallery/rain SVGs match `main` byte for byte across 4,693 configurations.\n\nTo reproduce the original layout bug, open `/network/?code=221331` on desktop and scroll to Style: previously the preview was entirely above the viewport. It now stays beside the controls. Run `npm run build && npm run test:network:browser`; parser/solver/URL regressions are in `src/links/network.test.js` and `src/pages/network.test.jsx`.\n\n| Before | After |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![Preview out of view](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-17-c029b2b48293/docs/case-studies/issue-17/screenshots/before-style-preview.png?raw=true) | ![Sticky preview beside styles](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-17-c029b2b48293/docs/case-studies/issue-17/screenshots/after-style-preview.png?raw=true) |\n\n![Network editor](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-17-c029b2b48293/docs/case-studies/issue-17/screenshots/network-desktop.png?raw=true)\n\n| Plain black, no card | Experimental overlap reduction |\n| --- | --- |\n| ![Plain black](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-17-c029b2b48293/docs/case-studies/issue-17/screenshots/plain-black.png?raw=true) | ![Reduced overlaps](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-17-c029b2b48293/docs/case-studies/issue-17/screenshots/collisions-after.png?raw=true) |\n\n[Requirement-by-requirement evidence, mobile/light screenshots and reproducible experiments](https://github.com/konard/konard.github.io/blob/issue-17-c029b2b48293/docs/case-studies/issue-17/README.md).\n\nThe overlap solver is a heuristic and remains opt-in. Static social link previews are shared across networks; attach the downloaded/copied image or use native file sharing for the actual picture. Clipboard/native sharing depend on browser support. An optional WebKit run could not finish within the container's 2.92 GiB memory limit (browser lost on the gallery); no passing WebKit run is claimed.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-10-24T14:58:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T18:01:55Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T18:01:55Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T18:01:55Z","merge_commit_sha":"aeb5b451e44765dc507521bc107b88cb984d422a","assignee":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"assignees":[{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/